<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces killed Lashkar-e-Taiba commander Lateef Ahmad Bhat and other attackers in a Kulgam encounter while recovering a body and weapon, and a man who had sheltered the commander months earlier was also linked to the cell. CRPF special DG reviewed operations at the Srinagar headquarters and intensified searches after the encounter. In Manipur, over 1,000 CRPF personnel were redeployed from Chhattisgarh, including the withdrawal of an anti-Naxal battalion, while Maharashtra announced a cash reward of Rs 1.5 lakh for information on weapons looted by Naxalites. The ISI revived a K‑2 plan to bring multiple terror groups into Punjab to target police. 437 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxNZTUtMHh1dEU3NlFyeWl5ODlMTmJPZXZIai16aGdDcWRTSUNmRk1vcjdRVjJMalQ0R2ZkdFdtS3F6TFlWeHpIZDZmdERQTUxidk1nTktpcFhSVGlJRnNoVG1NSWc0RkVWbFJzR2VNRXlYWDZyaUZmTWdVMTduYVJNV1JXbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Only Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxQQ25zdUx5a3lWTE5xaHg0d0lzWElneTFGdmJsZHVZWDV3Qjgwb0hKY3R5U1JRcG1JYk9MdEZBQ3phdjlEYzhCalBReEJEc05zRW9lTnRST3BYV01ISWFzcjAtay11Z1FLLUdXNElaQVNlTUpUY2tJV0JZdmc2VHFRem1zZzg0Nk1HbTEycFdiMmROWk9UdFp5aEo0Vy1zVm9xb0hWckZYSGY0cmdvUm9JNVN5NTBCd1U0YXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Kashmir Horizon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQaGNDMVE0VVVVM0pPa3pULWpyWC1jZUVWYVNkUUFVb1hZT3BKY2JtVmU5anhDS1p2M3lYMDFMa0N6a2VtbGk4bmY2WndWNGpNQUtwei1ORFAyXzZ4SE92ZFAwWExSYk05eEMwemhlMFhoLTNlOEozNDRQaDc5dzloa3RvbW9hVW9tVEtTUTB2b2ZwcmxQTXZZX09aZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Kashmir Horizon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Big News Network.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a 